{title: Deedar Ho Gaya}
{artist: Udit Narayan Anand Milind}
{key: C#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#m],        Ai doston
[B],        gori kanvari si haseena ke
[A],        bheege gulaabi narm honthon ka
[G#m],        Jheel si neeli neeli aankhon ka
deedaar ho gaya,        Mujhko pyar ho gaya
[C#m] [B],        Samjhe na koi bhi ishara
[B] [C#m],        aankhein jhukaye muskaye
[C#m] [B],        Baaten karu bhi to kaise
[B] [C#m],        dekho mujhe to sharam aaye
[C#m] [A] [B],        Dil ko churaye uski adaayen
[C#m] [A] [B],        usko niharein meri nigaahein
[B] [C#m],        Jaane na vo dilruba
Ai doston gori kanvari
Chanda ke mukhade pe dekho zulfon ka parda giraye
Gairon ke paas hai baithi mere kareeb na aaye
Deewana kar de uski jawani le angdai aaise deewani
Chha jaaye dil pe nasha,        Aye doston gori kanwaari
